{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38325","headline":"闻李翰林游池上有寄 · 吴融","name":"闻李翰林游池上有寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"花飞絮落水和流，玉署词臣奉诏游。\n四面看人随画鷁，中流合乐起眠鸥。\n皇恩自抱丹心报，清颂谁将白雪酬。\n不爲禁钟催入宿，前峰月上未回舟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38325.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38325","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}